<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 17,100 per dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 17,100 per dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 17,100 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 16,500 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 11	  January 10</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    17,100		16,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $1.912 million	  $3.326 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
